WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.610 --> 00:00:04.080
[Music]

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:09.919
Find your passion and stay with it, and your
career will come along.

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:15.650
It is so critical to have something you're
passionate about.

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:22.320
Discovery, phenomenon, services, whatever
it is... and don't worry about the, "Is this

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:27.890
publishable?", "Is this tenurable?", "Will
I get promoted for this?" because the answer

00:00:27.890 --> 00:00:32.189
to those questions will be yes or no, depending
on how you live it out.

00:00:32.189 --> 00:00:36.140
So, the most important, and frankly the
scariest thing, is to buy into something,

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:39.960
and stay with it, and learn about it, and
make it a part of your soul.

